<body>
    <h1>01.10.2025</h1>
    <div class=3D"Section1">
        <p>Apologies: Niels Borg (chair)</p>
<p>Participants: Johan N. (chair for this online meeting), Davy VD., Roland=
 W., Didi K., Thoman P., Jan P., Orkun D., Christian G., Nico P., Vincent T=
., Victoria N., Lukas H., Felipe I., Torsten B., Markus N., Gerry B., Tuomo=
 K., Andrew W., Ivan N., Markus N., Stian K., Stein-Roger K.</p>
<p><br></p>
<p>Agenda:</p>
<ul>
 <li data-uuid=3D"f3a99323-a4ba-4141-86eb-4863949f350a">IBC 2025</li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"b853a950-eecf-441f-81dd-a4486a53c035">Introduction to Git=
Hub</li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"a56b6f54-44fb-4c85-864d-c0707e59af34">Control API: introd=
uction</li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"91627d65-2a19-48b9-b2f9-61bfa750474b">Graphics spec: chan=
ges</li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"62e49a55-0703-45a1-a6c6-e4c442a455e4">Meeting frequency (=
input from the group)</li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"da14fea8-29e4-4e36-8372-b3e26393b2c9">Future roadmap for =
the spec (input from the group)</li>
</ul>
<p><br></p>
<p>Meeting notes/Action</p>
<ul>
 <li data-uuid=3D"e112490a-3867-4945-8f21-e541f5a000d3">IBC 2025 =E2=80=93 =
Ograf got a lot of traction. Many people came to see the demo. Follow-up ca=
lls organized with those interested in Ograf.</li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"95f379b3-afb8-43cd-b840-f16de2a558ac">Intro to GitHub: Jo=
han N. suggested to use GitHub to share comments on the ongoing work via =
=E2=80=9CIssues=E2=80=9D, =E2=80=9CPull requests=E2=80=9D are <em>proposal =
to merge a set of changes from one branch into another.</em></li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"56335bd8-40f1-4f55-a5c5-8b54292776d0">Control API introdu=
ction: Johan N. and Davy VD. have worked on the draft API (HTTP REST) avail=
able in a separate branch on GitHub. OpenAPI specification was used, capabl=
e to autogenerate documentation, server and client APIs interfaces</li>
 <ul>
  <li data-uuid=3D"9c48ab59-70b7-41d0-9142-5f6c4170f0fb">Johan went trough =
the API in the draft. <em>Upload </em>not defined but left to be vendor=E2=
=80=99s implementation. With respect to the target, Renderer and Renderer T=
arget defined. Renderer is the channel in CasparCG; Renderer Target is the =
layer in Caspar CG but it has been defined to be generic (e.g., layer, surf=
ace in 3D, portion of the screen, etc. CustomAction (not only for the Graph=
ics) but also for the renderer (e.g., clear all, rearrange graphics, etc.) =
to accommodate vendor specific actions</li>
  <li data-uuid=3D"e7350ac2-872a-4074-978d-fa4214fa87ac">Pull request on Gi=
t: after the graphic is loaded by the renderer in the renderer target, it c=
an be addressed using both ID and Instance ID: the request was to use only =
the Instance ID to manage multiple graphics per target</li>
  <ul>
   <li data-uuid=3D"bf52d36f-6dbe-4871-ad96-a8601fd1f1d9">Discussion on how=
 renderers deal with graphics (e.g., one graphic per layer, what about tran=
sitions); discussion will continue during the next meeting</li>
  </ul>
  <li data-uuid=3D"9d870b17-b6ed-4b4c-bb94-a470752fcecc">Question on how th=
e spec address replacement of graphics; Answer: through the manifest</li>
  <li data-uuid=3D"83f835f2-b734-4944-a60b-97265f6aeb5f">The group agreed t=
o publish the draft of the API after the next meeting</li>
  <li data-uuid=3D"9cf6e58a-3092-49fc-b44f-40ed7ef2050f">Question about add=
ressing security, authentication; Answer: these considerations will not be =
considered for now; Action: issue to be posted on Git with list of spec tha=
t can be used to address the problem (e.g. NMOS IS-04 and IS-10)</li>
  <li data-uuid=3D"bf15f3c2-9cf7-4028-ad52-16a8bb95f347">Meeting frequency:=
 the group agreed to keep meeting every two weeks</li>
  <li data-uuid=3D"3dbbea88-f99b-4033-93b8-0ce291feee39">The group agreed n=
ot to commit in advance to a future specification but to add the changes to=
 the current one keeping it backward compatible</li>
  <li data-uuid=3D"319bd2c4-3b84-4ae8-bb92-da876eba05f5">Timeline for relea=
sing the API (currently end of 2025/Q1 2026) to be revised depending on how=
 the discussion goes. Potential events to present the API: EBU PTS and NAB<=
/li>
  <li data-uuid=3D"7853f215-9faf-4dcd-95f6-5ded32b3810a">Roland and Victori=
a N. will work together to create an overview of what Ograf is about (not e=
asy to explain what Ograf is and how it fits in the pipeline)</li>
 </ul>
</ul>
<p><br></p>
<p>Links useful for the discussion</p>
<ul>
 <li data-uuid=3D"2efe684b-0f77-4f40-8d36-b8764c942aa4"><a href=3D"https://=
github.com/ebu/ograf/issues?q=3Dsort%3Acreated-asc%20%20is%3Aopen%20-label%=
3A%22Concluded%20-%20waiting%20for%20implementation%22" class=3D"external-l=
ink" rel=3D"nofollow">Link: Issues &amp; PRs on Github, used as basis for d=
iscussions</a>&nbsp;</li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"61903f97-8ada-481f-b9b7-17a544756730"><em><a data-href=3D=
"https://html-preview.github.io/?url=3Dhttps://github.com/ebu/ograf/blob/fe=
at/server-api/v1/specification/open-api/docs/index.html" href=3D"https://ht=
ml-preview.github.io/?url=3Dhttps://github.com/ebu/ograf/blob/feat/server-a=
pi/v1/specification/open-api/docs/index.html" class=3D"external-link" rel=
=3D"nofollow">Link to WIP Server-API docs</a></em></li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"a007c4ba-d9f2-40ca-b5a3-c88a8be4006b"><em><a href=3D"http=
s://github.com/ebu/ograf/tree/feat/server-api" data-href=3D"https://github.=
com/ebu/ograf/tree/feat/server-api" class=3D"external-link" rel=3D"nofollow=
">Link to github: feat/server-api branch</a></em></li>
</ul>
<p><em>Notes on github on the Render Target: </em><span style=3D"color:#000=
000;">&nbsp;<a href=3D"https://github.com/ebu/ograf/pull/12#issuecomment-33=
59283606" class=3D"external-link" rel=3D"nofollow">https://github.com/ebu/o=
graf/pull/12#issuecomment-3359283606</a></span></p>
<p><br></p>
